{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04926","headline":"饯唐州高使君赴任 · 卢藏用","name":"饯唐州高使君赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饯酒临丰树，褰帷出鲁阳。\n蕙兰春已晚，桐柏路犹长。\n祖逖方城镇，安期外氏乡。\n从来二千石，天子命唯良。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢藏用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}